If a clinician cares for a pregnant-person and the pregnant-person receives a prescribed-opioid and a facility has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-monitoring-capability and has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-evaluation-capability and has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-treatment-capability then the clinician should arrange a delivery for the pregnant-person at the facility.
If a clinician cares for a pregnant-person and the pregnant-person uses a nonprescribed-opioid and a facility has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-monitoring-capability and has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-evaluation-capability and has a neonatal-opioid-withdrawal-syndrome-treatment-capability then the clinician should arrange a delivery for the pregnant-person at the facility.
